So when we get the Core Book I plan on making a Tokusatsu themed campaign with lots of flashy superheroics and over the top villains and lots of hamminess. I was curious if anyone in forums would be interested in a campaign utilizing Tokusatsu heroes and villains? It'd take a lot of work but I'm super excited about setting it up. I feel judging by the Starter Kit a Tokusatsu themed campaign be really easy to utilize unlike other systems where it be hard to do.&nbsp;

